{title: 182 Veremos a Cristo}
{key: C}
{time: 3/4}
{lyricist: Dottie Rambo (1934-; Vers. esp.: Carlos A. Steger (1953-}
{composer: Dottie Rambo (1934- )}

{sov}
[C]El [G7]cielo se a[C]brirá y [F]le dará [C]paso;[G7]
[C]millones [Am]de estrellas lo [D7]alaba[G7]rán.
[C]Su [G]mirada [C]radian[F]te nos [C]dará santo gozo
[F]y contempla[C]remos [Am]al [Dm]Salva[G]dor.[C]
